{"id":"3bcdad272430b86d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STEvalRow.md","title":"STEvalRow","display":"STEvalRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STEvalRow","parameters":["B","C","k","z781","z782","z783"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STEvalRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>k</span><span>z781</span><span>z782</span><span>z783</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型判断与算法。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>z781</code>、<code>z782</code>、<code>z783</code>。</p>\n<p>独立后序类型综合表；失败也有显式分支。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STEvalRow B C k z781 z782 z783)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists g\n  (exists t\n    (exists r\n      (and\n        (exists z786 (and (@ Pair t r z786) (@ Pair g z786 z783)))\n        (and\n          (@ STSig B C k)\n          (and\n            (@ STCtx B g)\n            (and\n              (@ STRaw B C t)\n              (or\n                (exists z787\n                  (and\n                    (@ TVar z787 t)\n                    (or\n                      (exists z788 (and (@ App g z787 z788) (@ OK z788 r)))\n                      (and (not (exists z788 (@ App g z787 z788))) (@ Fail r)))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z789 (exists z788 (and (@ TConst z789 t) (and (@ App k z789 z788) (@ OK z788 r)))))\n                  (or\n                    (exists z790\n                      (exists z791\n                        (exists z792\n                          (exists z793\n                            (and\n                            (@ TLam z790 z791 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Cons z790 g z792)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z800\n                            (exists z801\n                            (and\n                            (in z800 z782)\n                            (and (@ App z781 z800 z801) (exists z802 (and (@ Pair z791 z793 z802) (@ Pair z792 z802 z801)))))))\n                            (or\n                            (exists z794 (exists z795 (and (@ OK z794 z793) (and (@ TArr z790 z794 z795) (@ OK z795 r)))))\n                            (and (@ Fail z793) (@ Fail r))))))))))\n                    (exists z796\n                      (exists z797\n                        (exists z798\n                          (exists z799\n                            (and\n                            (@ TApp z796 z797 t)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z803\n                            (exists z804\n                            (and\n                            (in z803 z782)\n                            (and (@ App z781 z803 z804) (exists z805 (and (@ Pair z796 z798 z805) (@ Pair g z805 z804)))))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z806\n                            (exists z807\n                            (and\n                            (in z806 z782)\n                            (and (@ App z781 z806 z807) (exists z808 (and (@ Pair z797 z799 z808) (@ Pair g z808 z807)))))))\n                            (or\n                            (exists z788 (and (@ STGoodApp z798 z799 z788) (@ OK z788 r)))\n                            (and (not (exists z788 (@ STGoodApp z798 z799 z788))) (@ Fail r))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" hr